Package: delphyrApp
Title: Accessible Study Workflows for Delphi Panels
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: A bilingual Shiny interface for synthetic Delphi studies, using
    injected transactional services from 'delphyr'. Separates trusted server
    identity from browser inputs and presents explicit save and submission
    receipts. Production authentication and deployment remain acceptance gates.
